    'Generate resonance structures by pushing arrows, without moving atoms or breaking σ bonds',
    'Recognize the three resonance patterns: lone pair next to a π bond, π bond next to a cation, and a π bond between atoms of different electronegativity',
    'Rank resonance contributors by octets, number of charges and electronegativity',
    'Describe the resonance hybrid and explain why delocalization stabilizes, and distinguish resonance from equilibria such as tautomerism',
